users on the internet,

00:53:41.550 --> 00:53:45.620
and they estimate this number
will reach 175 million in 2001.

00:53:45.620 --> 00:53:46.820
Trend number three.

00:53:46.820 --> 00:53:48.860
Not only are more people
using the internet,

00:53:48.860 --> 00:53:51.027
but more people are making
purchases on the internet

00:53:51.027 --> 00:53:52.070
than ever before.

00:53:52.070 --> 00:53:54.290
American Express estimated
that there were $5 billion

00:53:54.290 --> 00:53:57.277
