internet in 1997,

00:53:57.277 --> 00:53:59.360
and they estimate this
number to reach $80 billion

00:53:59.360 --> 00:54:01.940
in the year 2010.

00:54:01.940 --> 00:54:03.890
These trends, based
on our projection

00:54:03.890 --> 00:54:07.190
